guarantee: AC5 (implementation's damaged condition): state failed without a failure lists as damaged
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/storage.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
        CallState::Failed => ListState::Failed(meta.failure.as_ref()?.reason),
--- new
        CallState::Failed => {
            ListState::Failed(meta.failure.as_ref().map_or(FailReason::Storage, |f| f.reason))
        }
--- end
